Upstream-bound: yes
Subject: [match-neutral] 64-bit audit for overlays + stages (P3.1)

Replace literal createTask sizes/children with sizeof/offsetof (and
STAGE_CHILDREN_SIZE as N * sizeof(Task *)), make stage_select save arg
signed-safe (-0x80000000), store task pointers as void* (same width as
s32 on PS1) for field script commands and GFX vsync callbacks, and fix
FIGHTSTG_getActiveFighter pointer arithmetic.

